---
interface Props {hero?:boolean;}
const {hero=false}=Astro.props;
---
<figure class:list={['filter-diagram',{hero}]}>
<div class="diagram-heading"><span>小さな回路、大きな発見。</span><span class="diagram-code">FIG. 01</span></div>
<svg viewBox="0 0 480 240" role="img" aria-label="RCローパスフィルタ。入力から抵抗Rを通った出力点とGNDの間にコンデンサCを接続する。">
<g fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M48 82H148m72 0h190M310 82v62m-20 0h40m-40 10h40m-20 0v39m-20 0h40m-33 7h26m-18 7h10"/><rect x="148" y="70" width="72" height="24"/><circle cx="48" cy="82" r="4"/><circle cx="410" cy="82" r="4"/><circle cx="310" cy="82" r="4" fill="currentColor"/></g>
<g fill="currentColor" font-family="monospace" font-size="15"><text x="171" y="48">R</text><text x="150" y="118">1 kΩ</text><text x="348" y="151">C</text><text x="340" y="174">100 nF</text><text x="24" y="54">Vin</text><text x="385" y="54">Vout</text><text x="291" y="234">GND</text></g>
<path d="M26 159c9-32 18-32 27 0s18 32 27 0 18-32 27 0" fill="none" stroke="#b8e9c6" stroke-width="2"/><path d="M366 202c9-13 18-13 27 0s18 13 27 0 18-13 27 0" fill="none" stroke="#d3df77" stroke-width="2"/>
</svg>
<figcaption><span>RC ローパスフィルタ</span><span>f<sub>c</sub> = 1 / (2πRC)</span></figcaption>
</figure>
